2026-07-27T08:40:24.9112498Z Start test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
2026-07-27T08:40:24.9151113Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T08:40:24.9151846Z i /tmp/RtmpndQnRe/duckdb
2026-07-27T08:40:24.9152112Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T08:40:24.9152417Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:40:24.9152793Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:40:24.9153191Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:40:24.9153746Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:40:24.9154184Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T08:40:24.9336630Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:40:24.9420107Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:40:24.9722997Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:40:24.9820604Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
